[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"msg_06210b981fbeb1de016a207266c53c8196a04188489d7dfa2c","text":"Implemented a minimal RP2040 breakout in [index.circuit.tsx](/workspace/index.circuit.tsx), with JLCPCB-imported parts in [imports](/workspace/imports):\n\n- RP2040, AMS1117-3.3, W25Q16 flash, 12 MHz crystal, green LED\n- USB-C port, CC pulldowns, USB series resistors\n- 3.3 V regulator, RP2040 1.1 V core decoupling, I/O decoupling\n- dual 20-pin breakout headers, SWD/RUN/BOOT/GND test points\n- no tscircuit registry components imported, and no `routingDisabled`\n\nValidation completed:\n- `npm run typecheck`: passed\n- `tsci check netlist index.circuit.tsx`: 0 errors, 0 warnings\n- `tsci check placement index.circuit.tsx`: placement DRC 0 errors, 0 warnings\n- `tsci snapshot --pcb-only`: created/matched [index.circuit-pcb.snap.svg](/workspace/__snapshots__/index.circuit-pcb.snap.svg)\n\nCaveat: `tsci build index.circuit.tsx` writes `dist/index/circuit.json`, but the default autorouter reports 2 unsolved nodes. I tried `autorouterEffortLevel=\"100x\"` but it hung, and `autorouter=\"sequential_trace\"` fails with the built-in USB-C connector. I left the design on the default autorouter.\n\n**TSCircuit Developer Feedback**\n- Confusing/surprising: `tsci check placement` reports scary “courtyard collisions” in the summary even when placement DRC ends with `Errors: 0 Warnings: 0`.\n- Wasted most time: autorouter debugging; the build completed with exit code 0 while still embedding a `pcb_autorouting_error`.\n- Helpful changes: clearer mapping from failed autorouter node IDs like `cmn_162` to the actual net/component pins.\n- Friction points: generated JSX arrays caused persistent React `key` warnings; `sequential_trace` could not handle the built-in USB-C connector footprint; `jq` was unavailable, so circuit JSON inspection needed Node.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},"threadId":"019e8ead-3fe7-78e0-8925-282964e3e476","turnId":"019e8ead-3ff1-7fb2-8534-aaaeb294a686","completedAtMs":1780511343389}}
